{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本男神木村拓哉出道35年首度訪台開唱，昨日起連續兩天在台北流行音樂中心舉辦《Checkpoint》演唱會。</p><p>昨日54歲生辰的他，以白西裝搭豹紋襯衫登場，以《Head Shot》一曲揭開序幕，唱完3曲後再用日文跟粉絲打招呼，令全場5,000名</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:19:19.852436+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T03:57:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:32.056743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:32.056743+00:00","content_hash":"3309804ab82123c9487796e4981235ae73ff5db920120c3ca06aa469bd070aaf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}